+# Every git call this hook makes, and every git its children run, gets no fsmonitor program and no repo
+# hooks, so a repository's own config cannot run code through a kern hook (git 2.31+ reads
+# GIT_CONFIG_COUNT). The two pairs go after the pairs the environment already holds, which still apply
